\fs24 \cf0 Quick Backup Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\li504\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Task: classify COMI microscopy images into actin, mitochondria, and nucleus.\
Split: train on Z004-Z008, validate on Z009, and test on held-out Z010.\
Test set size: 297 images, with 100 actin, 97 mitochondria, and 100 nucleus images.\
Random Forest + PCA: 95.96% accuracy and 95.93% macro F1.\
Baseline CNN: 76.77% accuracy and 76.52% macro F1.\
ResNet18: 95.62% accuracy and 95.58% macro F1.\
Main conclusion: transfer learning with ResNet18 nearly matched the best classical baseline while adding deep visual feature learning and Grad-CAM interpretability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
