\f1\b0 \cf0 Why did you split by Z group instead of random images?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 To reduce data leakage. Images from the same acquisition group can be visually related, so random splitting may make the test set too similar to training. The Z004-Z008, Z009, Z010 split is stricter.\cell \row

