\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Which model is best?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Random Forest + PCA had the highest test accuracy at 95.96%, while ResNet18 was very close at 95.62%. The practical difference is about one image, so both are strong. ResNet18 is more useful for a deep-learning explanation and Grad-CAM interpretation.\cell \row

