\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Why did the Baseline CNN perform worse?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 It was trained from scratch on a relatively small dataset, so it had to learn all visual features from limited examples. ResNet18 started with pretrained image features, which helped it generalize much better.\cell \row

