\cf0 What was the largest CNN error?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The largest error was mitochondria predicted as nucleus: 38 test images. That shows the simple CNN struggled to separate some internal cellular texture patterns.\cell \row

