\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Why use ResNet18 instead of a bigger model?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 ResNet18 is a good size for a small project dataset. It is strong enough to learn rich visual features but not as heavy as larger networks that could overfit or require more compute.\cell \row

