\cf0 Why convert grayscale images for ResNet18?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pretrained ResNet18 expects three-channel input. A common approach is to duplicate the grayscale channel into three channels, then use the pretrained model while preserving the image information.\cell \row

